# Which path "Create my topics" (the bus-matrix flow) takes for star-schema
# design:
#   templates — connector-shipped deterministic templates when one covers the
#               synced entities; AI only as fallback. The default, and the
#               documented preference (the AI designer measured worse).
#   ai        — force the AI designer for EVERY source, including EO/Odoo.
#               Sets STAR_SCHEMA_TEMPLATES_DISABLED=1 on the backend.
#
# Set to `ai` on 2026-08-18 at the owner's request, to run the design flow
# without the pre-defined connector templates for a while.
#
# Mind what `ai` means in practice: designs cost AI tokens and minutes
# instead of being instant, topic/table names are no longer guaranteed
# identical across tenants, and a rebuild retires the template-built
# products and replaces them with AI-designed ones.
#
# Rollback: set this back to `templates` and push.
